OL,3,AI wasn't going to let others die, says
OL,4,AFlydubai captain who was attacked by
OL,5,Aco-pilot
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Indian captain of the Flydubai
OL,8,Fplane who was attacked by his co-pilot
OL,9,Fhas said he fought for his life but was
OL,10,Fdetermined not to let others die.
OL,12,FSpeaking to Indian Prime Minister
OL,13,FNarendra Modi, Smit Machchhar said he
OL,14,Fwas on the ground in the cockpit and
OL,15,Fstill being attacked when he realised
OL,16,Fthe plane was sinking and he had to do
OL,17,Fsomething.
OL,19,F"I was lying on the floor injured but I
OL,20,Ftold myself to go for one last push to
OL,21,Fopen the door from inside," he said.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
