OL,3,AI wasn't going to let others die, says
OL,4,AFlydubai captain who was attacked by
OL,5,Aco-pilot
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Others came in and also played a role
OL,8,F[in controlling the situation]. I was
OL,9,Fof course fighting for my own life but
OL,10,Fat the same time I knew I was not going
OL,11,Fto let others die," he added.
